flowchart LR

    %% --- Front Office ---
    Agent[Control Agent]
    Mobile[Android App]
    OCR[OCR / AI Engine]

    %% --- Core ---
    WS[IVISS Web Service]
    EXTDB[External Vehicle DB]
    MAINDB[IVISS Main DB]

    %% --- Partners ---
    API[Partner APIs]

    %% --- Back Office ---
    Admin[Admin / Supervisor]
    Dashboard[Back-Office Dashboard]

    %% --- Flow ---
    Agent --> Mobile
    Mobile -->|Plate input / Image| OCR
    OCR -->|Extracted plate| Mobile
    Mobile -->|Plate number| WS

    WS -->|Query| EXTDB
    EXTDB -->|Vehicle data / Not found| WS

    WS -->|Status checks| API
    API -->|Legal status| WS

    WS -->|Save control| MAINDB
    WS -->|Result & alerts| Mobile

    %% --- Gray card fallback ---
    Mobile -->|Gray card images| WS
    WS -->|Store pending data| MAINDB

    %% --- Back office operations ---
    Admin --> Dashboard
    Dashboard --> WS
    WS --> MAINDB
    WS --> EXTDB
